        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7ec2e1c6711d46cfb98c5d8458b593d6",
      "statement": "The SDK's public surface is exactly the __all__ list in __init__.py: Engine, Fact, Transformation, VerificationResult, Unknown, verify_physics, render_view, get_physics_rules, parse_problem; the fact store, DAG edge sets, and rule text are private to Engine and reachable through no public API.",
